# Brand conventions

## Single source of truth

- All colours, typography, and spacing come from `@anzuk/brand` (`packages/brand`).
- Never hardcode hex values in Astro components or pages.
- Use Tailwind utilities: `bg-anzuk-blue`, `text-anzuk-title`, `rounded-anzuk-button`, etc.
- Or CSS variables: `var(--anzuk-blue)`.

## Components

- Use `src/components/ui/Logo.astro` and `Button.astro` for brand-consistent UI.
- Brand preview pages live under `src/pages/brand/` and must use the same primitives as marketing pages.

## Tokens vs CMS

- **Static brand** (colours, fonts, logos): `packages/brand` in code
- **Marketing content** (copy, pages): Strapi `apps/cms`

## Brand guide

- Internal reference at `/brand` — always `noindex, nofollow` via `BrandLayout.astro`
- When adding new UI patterns, add a demo to `/brand/components`
